      "role": "user",
      "content": "that's a good start. i want to make sure the students really grasp the \"why\" behind it. can you expand on how these structural issues are basically hardcoded into the current system? like, even if people aren't being overtly racist today, how do these old frameworks still force certain outcomes for minority communities?",
